{
    "title": "My Aquapark: Idle Water Empire",
    "description": "Welcome to the Aquapark Idle game, the ultimate idle tycoon game where you can build and manage your own water park empire. Start small with just one employee by expanding your waterpark limits with thrilling water slides, wave pools, and more. As an idle tycoon game, you can passively earn income and even reinvest to further expand your empire.\r\n\r\nDecorate your aquapark with eye-catching photo zones, lush landscaping, and stunning water glides to create a unique and inviting atmosphere of an idle aqua park. Take care of your guests\u2019 needs by hiring new personnel who will keep an eye on their happiness and comfort. Do your best and turn your little boring waterpark to a large profitable Aquapark Idle business!\r\n\r\nChallenge yourself trying to avoid long queues with angry people - it\u2019s your chance to upgrade all your management skills. Make your aquapark business work the way you want it to! Dive into the game now and build, expand, and manage your own water park empire. Create unforgettable experiences for your guests and watch the entire business grow while you\u2019re relaxing!\r\n\r\nJoin Aquapark Idle and become the most successful businessman in this exciting combination of the idle and strategy genres!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the Aquapark Idle game, the ultimate idle tycoon game where you can build and manage your own water park empire. Start small with just one employee by expanding your waterpark limits with thrilling water slides, wave pools, and more. As an idle tycoon game, you can passively earn income and even reinvest to further expand your empire.<br><br>Decorate your aquapark with eye-catching photo zones, lush landscaping, and stunning water glides to create a unique and inviting atmosphere of an idle aqua park. Take care of your guests\u2019 needs by hiring new personnel who will keep an eye on their happiness and comfort. Do your best and turn your little boring waterpark to a large profitable Aquapark Idle business!<br><br>Challenge yourself trying to avoid long queues with angry people - it\u2019s your chance to upgrade all your management skills. Make your aquapark business work the way you want it to! Dive into the game now and build, expand, and manage your own water park empire. Create unforgettable experiences for your guests and watch the entire business grow while you\u2019re relaxing!<br><br>Join Aquapark Idle and become the most successful businessman in this exciting combination of the idle and strategy genres!",
    "summary": "Ride the waves to tycoon success in the idler\u2019s business - aquapark!",
